@model FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Models.Content.SiteContentListViewModel<FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Models.Content.PartnerDto>
@inject FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Infrastructure.SiteImageUrl SiteImageUrl

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "İş Ortakları";
}

<div class="pagetitle d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
    <div>
        <h1 class="mb-0">İş Ortakları</h1>
        <nav class="mt-1">
            <ol class="breadcrumb mb-0">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Ana Sayfa</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/icerik">İçerik</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">İş Ortakları</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
        <a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari/yeni" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
            <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i> Yeni İş Ortağı Ekle
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

@if (TempData["Success"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@TempData["Success"]</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

@if (TempData["Error"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@TempData["Error"]</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

@if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.ErrorMessage))
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@Model.ErrorMessage</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

<partial name="_ContentNav" model="@("is-ortaklari")" />

<div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
    <div class="card-body pt-3">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pb-2 border-bottom mb-3">
            <h5 class="card-title p-0 m-0">
                <i class="bi bi-building me-2 text-primary"></i>Kayıtlı İş Ortakları
                <span class="badge bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary border ms-2 fs-6">@Model.Items.Count</span>
            </h5>
        </div>

        @if (Model.Items == null || !Model.Items.Any())
        {
            <div class="text-center py-5">
                <i class="bi bi-building display-4 text-muted d-block mb-3"></i>
                <h6 class="text-body fw-semibold">Henüz iş ortağı eklenmemiş</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Birlikte çalıştığınız kurum, banka ve iş ortaklarının logolarını buradan ekleyip yönetebilirsiniz.</p>
                <a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari/yeni" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                    <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i> İlk İş Ortağını Ekle
                </a>
            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-3">
                @foreach (var item in Model.Items)
                {
                    var preview = SiteImageUrl.Preview(item.PartnerLogoUrl);

                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="card h-100 border shadow-none bg-body">
                            <div class="card-body p-3 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                                        <span class="badge bg-body-tertiary text-secondary border small">Sıra: #@item.DisplayOrder</span>
                                        @if (item.IsActive)
                                        {
                                            <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle small">
                                                <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i>Yayında
                                            </span>
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <span class="badge bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary border small">
                                                <i class="bi bi-eye-slash me-1"></i>Gizli
                                            </span>
                                        }
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="p-3 bg-body-tertiary rounded text-center mb-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height: 100px;">
                                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(preview))
                                        {
                                            <img src="@preview"
                                                 alt="@item.PartnerName"
                                                 style="max-height: 70px; max-width: 180px; object-fit: contain;" />
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <div class="text-muted small">
                                                <i class="bi bi-image me-1"></i>Logo yok
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    </div>

                                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-body text-center mb-1 text-truncate" title="@item.PartnerName">
                                        @item.PartnerName
                                    </h6>
                                </div>

                                <div class="pt-3 border-top mt-2 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-1">
                                    <a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari/@item.Id" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm flex-grow-1">
                                        <i class="bi bi-pencil me-1"></i> Düzenle
                                    </a>
                                    <form method="post" action="/icerik/is-ortaklari/@item.Id/sil" class="d-inline" data-confirm="«@(item.PartnerName)» iş ortağı silinsin mi? Bu işlem geri alınamaz.">
                                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" title="Sil">
                                            <i class="bi bi-trash"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</div>
